{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30914","headline":"失意书怀呈知己 · 马戴","name":"失意书怀呈知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直道何由啓圣君，非才谁敢议论文。\n心存黄籙兼丹诀，家忆青山与白云。\n麋鹿幽栖闲可近，鸳鸾高举势宜分。\n微生不学刘琨辈，剑刃相交拟立勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}